{"step_index":87,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-25T16:13:43Z","input_tokens":3308,"cache_read_tokens":88050,"output_tokens":1600,"content":"### Farmer-to-Buyer Marketplace & Escrow System\n\nThe complete blockchain layer has been built, compiled, and verified with all 12 core test scenarios passing and a simulated end-to-end demo.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **Recommended Workspace Setting:**  \n> Set your active workspace to: `C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace`.\n\n---\n\n### Project Structure & Artifacts\n\n- [`hardhat.config.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/hardhat.config.js): Hardhat configuration targeting Solidity `^0.8.20` with optimizer enabled.\n- [`contracts/UserRegistry.sol`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/UserRegistry.sol): Role registry and verification contract implementing [`UserRegistry`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/UserRegistry.sol#L10) for `FARMER`, `BUYER`, and `TRANSPORTER` roles via OpenZeppelin `AccessControl`.\n- [`contracts/MockStablecoin.sol`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/MockStablecoin.sol): 6-decimal payment token [`MockStablecoin`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/MockStablecoin.sol#L10) (`mUSD`) with testing mint capability.\n- [`contracts/Marketplace.sol`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/Marketplace.sol): Core escrow and batch contract [`Marketplace`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/Marketplace.sol#L13) enforcing the order state machine (`Placed` $\\rightarrow$ `Shipped` $\\rightarrow$ `Delivered` $\\rightarrow$ `Completed`, plus `Cancelled`, `Disputed`, `Resolved`), 7-day auto-release, and arbiter split resolution using `ReentrancyGuard` and `SafeERC20`.\n- [`contracts/SupplyChainTracker.sol`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/SupplyChainTracker.sol): IoT/carrier telemetry tracker [`SupplyChainTracker`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/contracts/SupplyChainTracker.sol#L10) logging location, temperature, and IPFS note hashes.\n- [`test/Marketplace.test.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/test/Marketplace.test.js): 12 focused Mocha/Chai tests covering registration, state machine transitions, escrow custody, cancellations, fee math, auto-release, disputes, and telemetry checks.\n- [`scripts/deploy.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/scripts/deploy.js): Local deployment script writing contract addresses and role configuration to [`deployments/localhost.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/deployments/localhost.json).\n- [`scripts/demo.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/scripts/demo.js): Interactive CLI demonstration running the full happy-path lifecycle, telemetry logging, and an arbiter-resolved dispute scenario with before/after wallet balances.\n- [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/farmer-marketplace/README.md): Architecture overview, state diagram, data boundaries, and future extensions.\n\n---\n\n### Test Suite Execution\n\nAll 12 unit tests pass:\n\n```\n  Farmer-to-Buyer Marketplace & Escrow System\n    ✓ 1. Registration and verification works\n    ✓ 2. Only a verified farmer can list a batch\n    ✓ 3. Full happy path: list -> order -> ship -> deliver -> farmer paid (check platform fee math)\n    ✓ 4. Unverified buyer can't order\n    ✓ 5. Can't order more than the available quantity\n    ✓ 6. Can't skip states (e.g. deliver before ship)\n    ✓ 7. Buyer cancels before shipment -> full refund\n    ✓ 8. Can't cancel after shipment\n    ✓ 9. Auto-release after 7 days (use hardhat time helpers)\n    ✓ 10. Dispute -> arbiter split resolution pays both sides correctly\n    ✓ 11. Tracker records checkpoints and returns the history\n    ✓ 12. Double confirm / double withdrawal fails\n\n  12 passing (6s)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Commands to Run\n\nFrom directory `C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\farmer-marketplace`:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Compile smart contracts\nnpx hardhat compile\n\n# 2. Run the 12 core tests\nnpx hardhat test\n\n# 3. Deploy contracts to local network\nnpx hardhat run scripts/deploy.js\n\n# 4. Run the end-to-end interactive lifecycle & dispute demo\nnpx hardhat run scripts/demo.js\n```","thinking":"Initial plan: first, set up the project and core components including a user registry and token. Second, implement the marketplace functionality. Third, design and integrate the tracker module. Fourth, establish comprehensive testing. Finally, create deployment scripts and a README file.\n\n\n"}
